# Security

Report suspected vulnerabilities privately to <%= @email %>. Include the affected
version, impact and a minimal reproduction; do not disclose private credentials.
Please avoid a public issue until maintainers have coordinated a fix.

Security fixes target the latest released version. If no version has been
published yet, report issues against the current main branch.

The project does not promise a response deadline. Maintainers will assess the
report, agree on disclosure where possible, and document any published fix.
